<title>USA: Telegroup Inc IPO terms cut.</title>
<headline>Telegroup Inc IPO terms cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terms of the initial public offering of Telegroup Inc were cut, lead underwriter Smith Barney said on Monday.</p>
<p>Five million shares of the international telecommunications firm will be sold in the offering for between $10 and $11. Previously, the underwriters had planned to offer 7.1 million shares between $14 and $16 each.</p>
<p>The shares will price Wednesday for trading Thursday on the Nasdaq under the symbol &quot;TGRP&quot;.</p>
